{"text":"and convince myself that I am at the world's largest Gryffindor reunion. Delivering a commencement address is a great responsibility, or so I thought, until I cast my mind back to my own graduation. The commencement speaker that day was the distinguished British philosopher, Baroness Mary Warnock. Reflecting on her speech has helped me enormously in writing this one, because it turns out that I can't remember a single word she said. This liberating discovery enables me to proceed without any fear that I might inadvertently influence you to abandon promising careers in business, the law, or politics.","words":[{"text":"and","start":0.0,"end":0.72},{"text":"convince","start":0.72,"end":1.06},{"text":"myself","start":1.06,"end":1.68},{"text":"that","start":1.68,"end":1.92},{"text":"I","start":1.92,"end":2.4},{"text":"am","start":2.4,"end":2.5},{"text":"at","start":2.5,"end":2.64},{"text":"the","start":2.64,"end":2.74},{"text":"world's","start":2.74,"end":3.66},{"text":"largest","start":3.66,"end":3.66},{"text":"Gryffindor","start":3.66,"end":4.32},{"text":"reunion","start":4.32,"end":4.78,"punct":"."},{"text":"Delivering","start":15.18,"end":15.86},{"text":"a","start":15.86,"end":16.06},{"text":"commencement","start":16.06,"end":16.46},{"text":"address","start":16.46,"end":16.96},{"text":"is","start":16.96,"end":17.24},{"text":"a","start":17.24,"end":17.36},{"text":"great","start":17.36,"end":17.64},{"text":"responsibility","start":17.64,"end":18.46,"punct":","},{"text":"or","start":18.92,"end":19.56},{"text":"so","start":19.56,"end":19.92},{"text":"I","start":19.92,"end":20.14},{"text":"thought","start":20.14,"end":20.58,"punct":","},{"text":"until","start":21.62,"end":21.84},{"text":"I","start":21.84,"end":22.06},{"text":"cast","start":22.06,"end":22.32},{"text":"my","start":22.32,"end":22.58},{"text":"mind","start":22.58,"end":22.82},{"text":"back","start":22.82,"end":23.1},{"text":"to","start":23.1,"end":23.36},{"text":"my","start":23.36,"end":23.52},{"tex